Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v8: pending: 51512210b3 (M159 merge 202e0e7f26, crbug
 585614984)

Interpreter/Maglev fix from V8 main, merged to 15.9 (M159) and not yet
to 15.6: initialize the receiver register on the optional-chain call
short-circuit, verify exception-edge liveness and clear dead registers
in Maglev. Same content as upstream; the CopyFrom hunk is re-anchored
for 15.6 and the two existing patches for bytecode-generator.cc and
maglev-graph-builder.cc are regenerated with it. Waits for the next
release; the cache epoch is not bumped here. V8 gitlink unchanged.
